[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 22322.31, "timestamp": "06:12:02", "text": "一起开玩笑，享受欢笑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22334.868, "timestamp": "06:12:14", "text": "谢天谢地，他全程都在焦点里吓人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22341.59, "timestamp": "06:12:21", "text": "哈哈，别担心，严厉的克洛诺斯。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22344.548, "timestamp": "06:12:24", "text": "欣赏这个玩笑和轻轻的拍打。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22347.51, "timestamp": "06:12:27", "text": "纯属娱乐。打开那张笑脸纸。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22349.59, "timestamp": "06:12:29", "text": "继续保持幽默感，我们来……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22351.51, "timestamp": "06:12:31", "text": "我们一起度过了美好的时光。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22353.59, "timestamp": "06:12:33", "text": "不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22356.23, "timestamp": "06:12:36", "text": "iPad"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22368.15, "timestamp": "06:12:48", "text": "当然，弗洛里安火山口，给你讲个笑话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22370.548, "timestamp": "06:12:50", "text": "专为你准备。为什么科学家不信任"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22373.59, "timestamp": "06:12:53", "text": "原子？因为它们构成了一切。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22375.03, "timestamp": "06:12:55", "text": "在地上打滚，哈哈大笑"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22377.19, "timestamp": "06:12:57", "text": "显微镜。继续笑，享受吧！"}]